A row argument must have kind Row
typename Thunk(a,r::Row) = [] (() -> (value:a|r)); fun() { (value=42) } : Thunk(Int, String)
exit : 1
stderr : @.*Kind mismatch: Type argument .* for type constructor Thunk has kind Type, but an argument of kind Row was expected.*

A row argument cannot replace a type argument
